#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:451
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:784
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run workflows on managed compute with cache infrastructure colocated for the best performance."
msgstr "在託管運算資源上執行工作流程，快取基礎設施與運算資源共置以達到最佳效能。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:467
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:790
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run continuous integration workflows on managed macOS and Linux runners, with cache infrastructure colocated next to compute for the best results and shared with your developer machines."
msgstr "在託管的 macOS 和 Linux 執行器上執行持續整合工作流程，快取基礎設施與運算資源共置以獲得最佳結果，並與您的開發機器共享。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:192
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:713
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Code is being produced faster and at greater volume than ever. Tuist plugs into the build systems you already use, on Xcode, Gradle, Bazel, Elixir, and Rust projects, providing the infrastructure that lets software integration and delivery keep pace."
msgstr "程式碼的產生速度與規模前所未有。Tuist 能整合您現有的建置系統，適用於 Xcode、Gradle、Bazel、Elixir 和 Rust 專案，提供基礎設施讓軟體整合與交付跟上開發步伐。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:323
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:736
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Share Xcode, Gradle, Bazel, and Rust build artifacts and audited Elixir dependency bundles across machines and CI. Rust caching is experimental."
msgstr "在機器與 CI 之間共享 Xcode、Gradle、Bazel 和 Rust 的建置產物，以及經過審核的 Elixir 相依套件束。Rust 快取功能目前為實驗性質。"